  "question": {
    "text": "Arrange in increasing order of solubility of AgBr in solutions given  here <br/><br/>(i) 0.1 M  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>             (ii) 0.1 M  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>            (iii) 0.2 M NaBr        (iv) pure water",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
