  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "AgBr     <math><mo>→</mo></math>       in  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  (Solubility increases, due to stable complex)<br/><br/>         <math><mo>→</mo></math>       in 0.1 M  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  (Solubility decreases)<br/><br/>         <math><mo>→</mo></math>       in 0.2 M NaBr (Solubility decreases more)<br/><br/>         <math><mo>→</mo></math>       in pure water (Normal dissociation)<br/><br/>Hence the order is<br/><br/>(iii) < (ii) < (iv) < (i)",
